# Out in the reach with the traffic: turn south and fly out to Little Mercy's lane, south
# of the field, as she comes along it from Lantern Dock; cross her path and bump her,
# point at her, dock at Lantern Dock, fly straight off it with W, and send a Mine order
# out to the field, where the ship parks on a rock's surface and cuts a hold while she
# flies on. Nine notes. The route for rock-field.perf.toml; no bot plays it.
